Photo assets directory — drop the institutional photo set here.

Expected files (referenced by data/scenes.ts):

  01-criancas-programando.jpg
  02-adolescentes-codigo.jpg
  03-oracao-em-grupo.jpg
  04-espaco-maker.jpg
  05-professores-ensinando.jpg
  06-colaboracao-criatividade.jpg

Recommended specs
  format       JPEG (or AVIF — Next/Image will negotiate)
  resolution   2560×1440 minimum (3840×2160 ideal)
  ratio        16:9 horizontal preferred
  weight       ≤ 480kb each after optimization
  treatment    cinematic color grade, soft natural light, low contrast
               highlights, deep navy shadows compatible with the
               existing palette
  focal point  match `focal` field in data/scenes.ts so subjects
               survive the parallax over-render

While files are absent, <CinematicImage /> renders a richly tonal
atmosphere placeholder — the page never breaks.
